@startuml
!include readable.iuml
title Comparing one planned day
participant CheckShortfallCommand as Check
participant DayPlan as Day
participant NutritionTargets as Targets
Check -> Check : findShortfalls(day)
Check -> Day : getTotalCalories()
Day --> Check : plannedTotal: long
Check -> Targets : getCalories()
Targets --> Check : dailyTarget: Integer
Check -> Check : addShortfall(..., plannedTotal, dailyTarget)
alt target supplied and plannedTotal < dailyTarget
 Check -> Check : append deficit line
else target omitted or met
 note over Check : No calorie shortfall is added.
end
note over Check, Targets
 Repeat for protein, carbs, and fats.
 No model data changes.
end note

@enduml
